      "writtenOn": "2022-03-30T18:44:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "i already filed a bug for the first one i saw, which was particularly stupid (\"please use a function that only MS implemented!\" --- who even +2ed that?!), but i\u0027ll kick off another run to see if there are any different ones...\n\n+srhines for the context [\"dwillemsen actually needed a newer -std for C, and it looks like recent updates to various GNU projects are starting to assume newer C standards now --- maybe the age of C99 is finally coming to an end!\"].",
      "parentUuid": "cdad7d56_eef0b530",
      "revId": "ab5e4c63e801a7b424d6638c353ea37c29d84576",
