      "writtenOn": "2022-03-30T19:30:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e dwillemsen actually needed a newer -std for C, and it looks like recent updates to various GNU projects are starting to assume newer C standards now\n\nMore that the GNU projects configure themselves without specifying a version, but the version used during `configure` and the build need to match. So with our regen scripts, they\u0027re using our clang prebuilts and sysroot and are defaulting to C17.",
      "parentUuid": "fed609bb_a64d4d7e",
      "revId": "ab5e4c63e801a7b424d6638c353ea37c29d84576",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
